# The race in the Arena (spec M6, part b): a test game whose player leads every other driver
# on points, loaded into the shop; the Underground Market and its way on to the Adversary's
# screen, Return there, the preview of the race against the Adversary and the race, the
# player standing on the grid while the Adversary races its nine laps; Return on the race's
# end, then on each page of the results and on the statistics. Run with --watch (without
# --no-ai) on an idle machine: a frame the original takes two ticks over changes which of the
# Adversary's guns fires. A shot every 100 ms through the preview, then every 500 ms, and
# every 250 ms from the race's end.
